WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.676
Strong passwords and a second lock keep criminals out of your accounts.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.884
Use a long passphrase of four or more random words. Length matters most.

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:14.393
Use a different password for every important account.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.556
A password manager can remember them for you.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:22.549
Turn on two-step verification, so a new login also needs a code.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:29.162
And never share a login code or PIN. Anyone who asks is trying to steal your account.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:43.640
Before you move on, check: Change your main email password to a long passphrase. Use different passwords for important accounts. Turn on 2-step verification on WhatsApp. Never share a login code.

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:47.006
In the next lesson: Scams and phishing.
